<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia govt to issue forecasts today.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia govt to issue forecasts today.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian government will issue its mid-year review of 1996/97 budget forecasts at 0400 GMT (3 p.m.) today, Treasurer Peter Costello's office said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
